    "sub_name": "國際行銷管理",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNATIONAL MARKETING MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "此科目的設計主要是讓學生熟悉有關國際市場與行銷決策。此科目亦會提供學生有關全球行銷之主要的理論架構與實務性之操作，尤其是如何協助以出口為主要活動之中小型企業。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to familiarize students with the nature of international markets and marketing decisions. This course also focuses on providing an understanding of the major marketing tools and techniques in the context of exporting activities of small and medium-sized firms.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
